Installation Notes------------ -----lib/vga.h and lib/vgalib.h need to go in the directory 2/ORCADEFS.lib/lvga needs to go in the directory 2/ (ORCA's LIBRARIES folder).And that's about it.  Documentation is where you can find it,and also in the two Microsoft Word documents. We'll include Teachversions here soon.To join an Internet mailing list of Second Sight developers,send email to majordomo@hypermall.com with the following inthe body (_not_ the subject):  subscribe ss-devel